WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.793
Eddy drove to the construction site.

2
00:00:09.794 --> 00:00:12.861
He went slowly.

3
00:00:12.862 --> 00:00:19.976
He didn't want to crash again.

4
00:00:19.977 --> 00:00:24.312
"Hey, Jeb," said Eddy.

5
00:00:24.313 --> 00:00:39.307
"Let's play in the dirt!"

6
00:00:39.308 --> 00:00:44.048
Poppy and Dipper drove over.

7
00:00:44.049 --> 00:00:46.729
"Eddy!" said Poppy.

8
00:00:46.730 --> 00:00:49.879
"Don't you want to play tag?"

9
00:00:49.880 --> 00:00:54.493
"No," said Eddy.

10
00:00:54.494 --> 00:00:59.126
"I don't want to crash again."

11
00:00:59.127 --> 00:01:04.297
Jeb loaded dirt into Eddy's dumper.

12
00:01:04.298 --> 00:01:11.291
Eddy dumped the dirt.

13
00:01:11.292 --> 00:01:14.705
"You won't crash," said Dipper.

14
00:01:14.706 --> 00:01:17.228
"Don't you want to go fast?"

15
00:01:17.229 --> 00:01:29.696
"No," said Eddy.

16
00:01:29.697 --> 00:01:32.055
Zippy drove over.

17
00:01:32.056 --> 00:01:36.354
"Hey, slowpoke!" he said.

18
00:01:36.355 --> 00:01:42.283
"Want to race?"

19
00:01:42.284 --> 00:01:46.456
"Grr!" said Eddy.

20
00:01:46.457 --> 00:01:49.890
"Leave Eddy alone," said Dipper.

21
00:01:49.891 --> 00:01:51.603
"He doesn't want to—"

22
00:01:51.604 --> 00:01:56.320
Roar! Eddy roared his engine.

23
00:01:56.321 --> 00:02:00.334
He quickly checked his brakes.

24
00:02:00.335 --> 00:02:16.148
Then he took off!

